        "text": "I highly recommend Desert roofing! They have been my go to roofing company. Many years ago, after a monsoon, my rental property's roof had some damage. We hired another contractor to repair only to find horrible leaks existing when the next monsoon season came. We found Desert Roofing from a friend's referral and they fixed the roof once and for all. They were competitively priced and provided excellent customer service. Many years later and still no issues. I was so impressed, that I have carried their business card now for 5 years in case I need something more!",
