        "text": "Found a roof leak and needed it repaired quickly with more rain on the way.  Called several companies but none could come out and assess the problem quickly.  Called Desert Roofing and they came out the same day. In fact, they made it a point to come out even though they were booked for the day. Charles came out after business hours, quickly identified the problem, explained what had to be done and gave me a very reasonable price.  They fixed the problem the next day without delay and even included a five year warranty.  Great job all around and excellent customer service.",
