        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I’ve been a satisfied Integrity Roofing customer for many years, inclusive of the previous and now current owner, Steve Payne. His conscientious employees do excellent work at a fair price. Our most recent interaction was our annual roof inspection (covered by their excellent warranty), conducted by a relatively new employee, Ira Latham. He was professional and personable. I remain impressed with this excellent, reliable company.",
