        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Energy Edge Roofing is one of the most professional companies I have run across in my search for a premier roofing company that I can count on.  I highly recommend them.  The owner, Kevin Fabrycki is kind, compassionate and listens before he speaks.  These are qualities you don’t find in today’s business world.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
